---
import SolutionPage from '../../../layouts/SolutionPage.astro';
---

<SolutionPage
  title="Air Quality"
  parent="Mitigate"
  oneliner="Indoor air is typically more polluted than outdoor air — and you spend 90% of your time breathing it."
  slug="environment-air"
  canonicalPath="/solutions/environment/air"
  showSolutionPath={false}
  showDisclaimer={false}
>
  <!-- ── Why This Matters ── -->
  <h2>Why This Matters</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>The EPA documents indoor air as 2–5x more polluted than outdoor air in the average American home — VOCs, particulates, and mold continuously off-gas from furniture, flooring, and HVAC systems</li>
    <li>Mycotoxins from hidden mold act as direct neurotoxins — even subclinical exposure impairs cognitive function, disrupts the HPA axis, and generates chronic inflammatory load</li>
    <li>A quality HEPA + activated carbon unit in your bedroom is the single highest-ROI environmental upgrade most men haven't made — you breathe that air for 7–8 hours nightly</li>
  </ul>

  <!-- ── Featured Products — E-Commerce Hero ── -->
  <h2 class="section-eliminate">Featured Products</h2>
  <p>Protocol-matched products for your air quality protocol. Affiliate relationships disclosed below.</p>
  <div class="product-grid">
    <div class="product-card">
