    </div>
    <div class="product-card">
      <h3>Whole-Room HEPA + Carbon Air Purifier</h3>
      <p class="product-why">Covers open-plan living and work spaces — removes particulates and VOCs.</p>
      <p>Large-room capacity unit. True HEPA + activated carbon for comprehensive filtration of living areas.</p>
      <span class="notify-pill">Notify Me When Available</span>
      <!-- TODO: wire to Stripe Checkout when shop is live — /api/checkout?sku=whole-room-air-purifier -->
      <a href="mailto:hello@my4mlife.com?subject=Pre-order: Whole-Room Air Purifier" class="btn-cart">Notify Me →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="product-card">
      <h3>MERV-13 HVAC Filter Subscription</h3>
      <p class="product-why">Most commonly neglected maintenance task with the most widespread impact.</p>
      <p>Quarterly delivery of the correct filter size for your HVAC system — so the replacement actually happens on schedule.</p>
      <span class="notify-pill">Notify Me When Available</span>
      <!-- TODO: wire to Stripe Checkout when shop is live — /api/checkout?sku=merv13-hvac-subscription -->
