      <p class="product-why">Screens for pathogenic mold species — the root cause of persistent brain fog and fatigue.</p>
      <p>ERMI-style test kit for preliminary mold assessment in household dust. Know before you treat.</p>
      <span class="notify-pill">Notify Me When Available</span>
      <!-- TODO: wire to Stripe Checkout when shop is live — /api/checkout?sku=home-mold-test -->
